      "Raw discovery headers and rows: ABNs, legal names, a populated trading/other name (Georges Riverkeeper), Business address type, PO Box examples, websites, dates, flags, and operating-country values.",
      "Ontology contract: legal_name versus trading_name, ABN checksum semantics, address fields, absence of status/reporting-group/operating-purpose fields, observation envelope, and provenance/linking rules.",
      "Previous mapping, unmapped-field rationales, limitations, and validation feedback (250 validation rows, passed; not treated as semantic ground truth)."
